    "notes": "Genuine UN Arabic document: Acrobat PDFMaker 6.0 for Word + Distiller 6.0, 95 pages, Traditional Arabic fonts. Mixed Type0 fonts with ToUnicode and simple TrueType subsets WITHOUT ToUnicode; ToUnicode CMaps map glyphs to Arabic presentation forms (U+FExx), and pdfminer extraction yields thousands of presentation-form characters plus PUA chars on pp.3-5. pdfium normalizes these silently."
